ities. If you&#8217;re looking for cheap <a href="https://www.student.com/uk/liverpool">student accommodation in Liverpool</a> then you can start your search on this website or on our app. Make sure to also sign-up for a free account. This way a member of our bookings team can help you find the ideal student home just for you.</p>
<p>One of the good things about Liverpool, compared to for example London, is that student accommodation is much cheaper on average. You can find some really good student properties that won&#8217;t break the bank but are still in good locations, near universities and the city centre. In this post we&#8217;ve listed some of the most popular options for cheap student accommodation in Liverpool.</p>
<h2>Atlantic Point</h2>
<p><a href="https://www.student.com/uk/liverpool/p/liberty-atlantic-point">Atlantic Point</a> is in a great location near the city centre. This means you&#8217;ll have great shopping and nightlife options right at your doorstep, in addition to being able to get to your campus quickly. Especially the Liverpool John Moores University city campus is really close by, just a 5-minute walk away. In Atlantic Point you&#8217;ll live in a private en-suite room, meaning you&#8217;ll have a bedroom and a bathroom just for yourself. The rooms are fully furnished and the property facilities include an entertainment room, a communal laundry room and bike storage. Prices start from £107/week.</p>
<a href="https://www.student.com/uk/liverpool/p/liberty-atlantic-point"><img class="aligncenter wp-image-11676" src="https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/liv_atp_crm_f16_r2_bed_02_mg_3757_JJ_02-acbc4ee52f034718d7e942d1bc32623b-425x283.jpeg" alt="Atlantic Point offers student accommodation with lots of activities right at your doorstep" width="570" height="379" srcset="https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/liv_atp_crm_f16_r2_bed_02_mg_3757_JJ_02-acbc4ee52f034718d7e942d1bc32623b-425x283.jpeg 425w, https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/liv_atp_crm_f16_r2_bed_02_mg_3757_JJ_02-acbc4ee52f034718d7e942d1bc32623b-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/liv_atp_crm_f16_r2_bed_02_mg_3757_JJ_02-acbc4ee52f034718d7e942d1bc32623b-840x560.jpeg 840w, https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/liv_atp_crm_f16_r2_bed_02_mg_3757_JJ_02-acbc4ee52f034718d7e942d1bc32623b.jpeg 1050w" sizes="(max-width: 570px) 100vw, 570px" /></a>
<h2>Grand Central</h2>
<p>As the name suggests, you&#8217;ll be in a very central location at the <a href="https://www.student.com/uk/liverpool/p/unite-students-grand-central">Grand Central</a>. Just over a 5-minute walk to Liverpool John Moores University and about 15 minutes on foot to the University of Liverpool, you&#8217;ll also be right next to Liverpool Lime Street and Liverpool Central stations. Grand Central is equipped with airy rooms, fresh decor and laundry facilities, meaning you can quickly make this place feel like a home when you study in Liverpool. There are several options for how you want to live, with private rooms with shared bathrooms, private rooms with en-suite bathroom and fully self-contained studio apartments all on offer. Prices start from £105/week.</p>
<a href="https://www.student.com/uk/liverpool/p/unite-students-grand-central"><img class="aligncenter wp-image-11672" src="https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/property-19393-f24304929ec33f0398ae85a804c212ca-425x259.jpeg" alt="Grand Central offers student living in a great location in Liverpool city centre" width="570" height="347" srcset="https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/property-19393-f24304929ec33f0398ae85a804c212ca-425x259.jpeg 425w, https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/property-19393-f24304929ec33f0398ae85a804c212ca-768x467.jpeg 768w, https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/property-19393-f24304929ec33f0398ae85a804c212ca-840x511.jpeg 840w, https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/property-19393-f24304929ec33f0398ae85a804c212ca.jpeg 1150w" sizes="(max-width: 570px) 100vw, 570px" /></a>
<h2>Agnes Jones House</h2>
<p>Located in Liverpool&#8217;s Georgian Quarter, <a href="https://www.student.com/uk/liverpool/p/agnes-jones-house">Agnes Jones House</a> is about a 10-minute walk from both the University of Liverpool and Liverpool John Moores University. With prices starting at just £85/week, this is the perfect property for a student looking for a cheap, convenient home away from home at university. With an entertainment room, bike storage and laundry, everything you need is on-site.</p>
<a href="https://www.student.com/uk/liverpool/p/agnes-jones-house"><img class="aligncenter wp-image-11667 " src="https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/Premium-Non-Ensuite-Double-Bed-1200px-9625b98b970f94c8cd45fc08c7489790-425x283.jpeg" alt="Agnes Jones House offers cheap student accommodation in Liverpool" width="570" height="379" srcset="https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/Premium-Non-Ensuite-Double-Bed-1200px-9625b98b970f94c8cd45fc08c7489790-425x283.jpeg 425w, https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/Premium-Non-Ensuite-Double-Bed-1200px-9625b98b970f94c8cd45fc08c7489790-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/Premium-Non-Ensuite-Double-Bed-1200px-9625b98b970f94c8cd45fc08c7489790-840x560.jpeg 840w, https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/Premium-Non-Ensuite-Double-Bed-1200px-9625b98b970f94c8cd45fc08c7489790.jpeg 1050w" sizes="(max-width: 570px) 100vw, 570px" /></a>
<h2>St Andrew&#8217;s Gardens</h2>
<p><a href="https://www.student.com/uk/liverpool/p/st-andrew-s-gardens">St Andrew&#8217;s Gardens</a> is the cheapest accommodation we currently list in Liverpool, with prices starting at just £84/week. Even at this price you&#8217;ll still be within walking distance of your campus. You can walk to Liverpool John Moores University in about 5 minutes and to the University of Liverpool in 10 minutes. You&#8217;ll get to live in a private bedroom, and depending on the room you choose, your bathroom can be either shared or private. All bills are included in the price as well.</p>
<a href="https://www.student.com/uk/liverpool/p/st-andrew-s-gardens"><img class=" wp-image-12380 aligncenter" src="https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2022/07/St-Andrews-Gardens-425x234.jpeg" alt="St Andrew's Gardens offers very cheap accommodation for students in Liverpool" width="570" height="314" srcset="https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2022/07/St-Andrews-Gardens-425x234.jpeg 425w, https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2022/07/St-Andrews-Gardens-768x423.jpeg 768w, https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2022/07/St-Andrews-Gardens-840x463.jpeg 840w, https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2022/07/St-Andrews-Gardens-1200x661.jpeg 1200w, https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2022/07/St-Andrews-Gardens.jpeg 1250w" sizes="(max-width: 570px) 100vw, 570px" /></a>

<h2>Falkland House</h2>
<p><a href="https://www.student.com/uk/liverpool/p/falkland-house">Falkland House</a> has a great location near the Royal Liverpool University Hospital. You can walk to Liverpool John Moores University in 10 minutes and to the University of Liverpool in under 15. The rooms are fully furnished and all bills, including Wi-Fi, are included in the rent. The facilities include a bike storage, entertainment room and communal laundry. You&#8217;ll also be in a safe environment with an onsite manager and a security officer always on-site. Prices start from £118/week.</p>
<a href="https://www.student.com/uk/liverpool/p/falkland-house"><img class="aligncenter wp-image-11674 " src="https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/property-46935-a224f4e843f21d9be6eb4814abfa42c9-425x283.jpeg" alt="Falkland House is a great base for student living in Liverpool" width="570" height="379" srcset="https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/property-46935-a224f4e843f21d9be6eb4814abfa42c9-425x283.jpeg 425w, https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/property-46935-a224f4e843f21d9be6eb4814abfa42c9-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/property-46935-a224f4e843f21d9be6eb4814abfa42c9-840x560.jpeg 840w, https://static.student.com/storm-frontend-wp/uploads/2021/07/property-46935-a224f4e843f21d9be6eb4814abfa42c9.jpeg 1050w" sizes="(max-width: 570px) 100vw, 570px" /></a>

<p><em>All prices are correct as of 15th February 2023. For full details please refer to the property page listing on <a href="https://www.student.com/">Student.com</a> or <a href="https://www.student.com/contact">contact</a> a member of the team for confirmation of pricing. Our bookings team are always happy to answer any questions you may have and help you find the ideal student home for you.</em></p>
